<title>USA: Wis.Health, Educational yields 6.20 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Wis.Health, Educational yields 6.20 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co Inc said it repriced $35.190 million of Wisconsin Health &amp; Educational Facilities Authority revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 6.20 percent in 2026.</p>
